In rk_action_timer(), call rk_state_record_timer_fire(), schedule_work(), then
mod_timer() with jiffies + msecs_to_jiffies(RK_ACTION_INTERVAL_MS).

In rk_action_run(), read rk_state_actions_enabled() once. If it is true, call
rk_state_record_worker_run().

In rk_scheduler_start(), store the borrowed state, initialize action_work and
action_timer, then arm the timer. In rk_scheduler_stop(), call
timer_shutdown_sync() before cancel_work_sync(), then clear the borrowed pointer.
